EXT 97/1-0 (32)}) (9. Nc3 Nbd7 $11) 9... Re8 10. h3 {Asegura g4} b5 11. Nfd2
Qe7 12. a4 Bb7 13. axb5 Nxd5 $2 (13... Bxd5 14. e4 $11) 14. Nc4 $14 Qe6 15. Na5
