{B01: Scandinavian Defence} 1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qa5 4. Bc4 c6 5. Nf3
Nf6 6. O-O Bf5 7. d3 e6 8. h3 Nbd7 9. Bd2 (9. Nh4 Bg6 $14) 9... O-O-O (9... Qc7
10. a4 $14) 10. Nd5 Qa4 11. Ne3 (11. Bb3 Qa6 12. Bc4 Qa4 $14) 11... Bg6 $11 12.
a3 {Controls b4} c5 13. b4 Qc6 14. Qe2 Bh5 15. g4 Bg6 16. bxc5 Bxc5 17. Rfb1 h5
18. g5 Nd5 19. Nxd5 exd5 20. Bb5 Qc7 21. d4 Rhe8 22. Qf1 Bd6 (22... Bb6 $5 $14
{is interesting}) 23. Rb3 $18 Be4 (23... Bxc2 $4 {the pawn must remain
untouched} 24. Rc3 Qxc3 25. Bxc3 $18) 24. Rc3 Qxc3 25. Bxc3 Bxf3 26. Ba5 b6 27.
Bb4 Re6 (27... Bc7 28. Re1 Kb8 29. Be7 $18) 28. Bxd6 Rxd6 29. a4 (29. Qc1 {
makes it even easier for White} Be4 30. Qf4 Nb8 31. Qxf7 a6 $18) 29... h4 (
29... Be4 30. a5 Kb7 31. axb6 Rxb6 32. Qe2 $18) 30. Ra3 (30. Qe1 {keeps an
even firmer grip} Be4 31. f3 Bg6 $18) 30... Be4 31. f3 Bf5 32. a5 Kb8 (32...
Kb7 {is still a small chance} 33. Qe1 Nb8 $18) 33. Qe1 g6 (33... Nc5 {a last
effort to resist the inevitable} 34. Qe7 Nb7 $18) 34. Qe7 (34. Qe7 Re8 35.
Qxd6+ Kc8 36. axb6 Re1+ 37. Kf2 Kd8 38. b7 Rf1+ 39. Kxf1 Bd3+ 40. Rxd3 a5 41.
Qxd7#) 1-0

